            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "In our testing, mandelic acid formulas lasted longest by a wide margin, delivering 24 hours or more from a single application because they block the enzymatic reaction that creates odor rather than fighting bacteria continuously. Among traditional sticks, baking soda formulas ran 13 to 16 hours and magnesium hydroxide formulas 10 to 14 hours.",
