          <p>
            A caution on reading those durations: they are panel-scored medians across at least three testers, and individual variation in this category is larger than in almost any other product we test. Underarm bacterial populations differ between people enough that a formula giving one tester 15 hours gave another 9. Treat the numbers as a ranking rather than a promise, and give any product a full week before judging it.
